{"id":"658226","name":"沙茶牛肉蒸腐竹","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658226/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"腐竹","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腐竹用温水泡软。","img":"images/658226/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"碗中放入姜末、蒜末、沙茶酱、蚝油。","img":"images/658226/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"呛入热油。","img":"images/658226/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入适量的盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/658226/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把拌好的酱汁倒入切好的牛肉片内，再加入淀粉拌均匀。","img":"images/658226/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"腐竹摊入碗底。","img":"images/658226/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"表面放入牛肉片。","img":"images/658226/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"水开入锅蒸七八分钟即可。","img":"images/658226/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间到，撒入小葱。","img":"images/658226/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658226/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}